      <li class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q">Is it better to take a car loan or pay cash in India?</h3>
        <p class="faq-a">There is no single right answer — it depends on what your cash would otherwise do. If you have investments earning returns higher than your loan interest rate, keeping money invested and taking a loan can make financial sense. If you have no investments and the cash is sitting idle in a savings account, paying outright saves you the interest cost and keeps things simple.</p>
